<title>JAPAN: Daido Hoxan shares suspended from trade on TSE.</title>
<headline>Daido Hoxan shares suspended from trade on TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Friday that trading of Daido Hoxan Inc's shares and convertible bonds had been suspended for the whole day.  </p>
<p>Japanese business daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported on Friday that Daido Hoxan is considering taking over troubled Tateho Chemical Industries Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The Tokyo bourse said trade was halted as information about the possible merger was unclear.</p>
